WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.580
You need about 10 spinach leaves, coffee filters, a glass jar with a lid, and adult

2
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.720
-only rubbing alcohol and safety glasses.

3
00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:13.393
Your child cuts filter strips and tears spinach.

4
00:00:13.953 --> 00:00:15.833
The adult pours alcohol and mashes.

5
00:00:16.493 --> 00:00:18.373
Cap the jar for 15 to 30 minutes.

6
00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.613
Then the adult stands a strip in it.

7
00:00:21.317 --> 00:00:23.777
Colors climb the strip over 30 to 90 minutes.

8
00:00:24.197 --> 00:00:27.437
Expect a wide green band, and often a thin yellow band.

9
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.060
The adult handles the rubbing alcohol from start to finish.

10
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.340
It is poisonous to swallow and catches fire easily.

11
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.620
Children look, never touch.

12
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.900
Ages 5 to 7 do leaf rubbing instead, with no alcohol.
